    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Admin API for cluster management operations.</para>
<para>Provides RESTful HTTP endpoints for:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Topology management (add/remove shards)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Rebalancing operations (trigger/monitor)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Health monitoring (includes per-shard repair status when <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_shard_repair_engine" kindref="compound">ShardRepairEngine</ref> is set)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Routing statistics</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Shard repair / anti-entropy (rebuild triggers &amp; status)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>All endpoints require operator certificate for authorization. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
